{{!-- Filled by assets/js/toc.js; removes itself when the
article has no headings. widget-plain drops the card box (padding,
border, background) every other widget carries — the TOC's own
rail line is enough furniture, wrapping it in a second box on top
of that read as a box inside a box. --}}
<div class="widget widget-plain">
    <h4 class="widget-title">{{> "icons/list-icon"}} {{t "On this page"}}</h4>
    <ul class="toc-list" data-toc></ul>
</div>
